# Cloudflare Pages response headers — Move Out Japan
#
# REPAIR NOTE (Phase 5): the site previously shipped only two cache rules and
# no security headers. The `/*` block below adds a Content-Security-Policy,
# clickjacking protection, MIME-sniffing protection, a referrer policy, a
# permissions policy and HSTS.
#
# WHY 'unsafe-inline' REMAINS IN script-src:
# the codebase has 26 inline event handlers in HTML (24 onclick, 2 onsubmit)
# plus onclick/onkeydown handlers emitted by assets/js/main.js and rendered
# through innerHTML. Browsers enforce script-src against every one of them, so
# a CSP without 'unsafe-inline' would break the FAQ accordion, mobile menu,
# blog cards and the quote form. style-src needs it too: 140 inline style=""
# attributes plus <style> blocks in 404.html, privacy.html and sitemap.html.
# Removing those handlers is worthwhile follow-up work; it was not done here
# because it would be a large behavioural rewrite. The allowance is disclosed
# rather than silently relied upon.
#
# X-XSS-Protection: 0 disables the legacy browser XSS auditor, which can
# itself introduce vulnerabilities (OWASP guidance is to set it to 0).
#
# HSTS: HTTPS is already enforced for this host (HTTP answers 301) and there
# are no HTTP-only subdomains, so includeSubDomains is safe. `preload` is
# deliberately NOT set — preload lists are painful to reverse.
#
# NOTE: no comment lines appear inside rule blocks, so this file can be
# parsed by any spec-compliant _headers implementation.
#
# This is defence-in-depth only. It does not make the site "secure", and the
# client-side form validation is not a security boundary.

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://api.emailjs.com; manifest-src 'self'; frame-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; form-action 'self'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: accelerometer=(), camera=(), geolocation=(), gyroscope=(), magnetometer=(), microphone=(), payment=(), usb=()
  X-XSS-Protection: 0
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains

/sitemap.xml
  Content-Type: application/xml; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600

/robots.txt
  Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
